## Repository layout

`skills/{{SKILL_NAME}}/` is the skill, the only folder an agent needs.

```text
skills/{{SKILL_NAME}}/
  SKILL.md                  instructions and metadata
  evals/                    test cases and trigger queries
scripts/validate_skill.py   validator, run before every commit
AGENTS.md                   rules for agents maintaining this repository
CHANGELOG.md                version history
```

## Development

```bash
python3 scripts/validate_skill.py
```

The rules for changing the skill, including how to keep it agent-agnostic, are in [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md).

